png", "id": "1027431780018061", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1027431783351394_5995475647017093342_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wx3-uYcaZ0wQ7kNvwHibZam&_nc_oc=AdojliurgEb_si7DlD_OAWhgU9O_Qvlsv42DbP0TEb_jwDR96AKIjstTgSzClyh-YIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEo7ck1fl-TZFCzKos6Hw08hcG-VknCtzx9ViGZlCXGag&oe=6A7890BB"}, {"file_name": "Screen7.png", "id": "1716092686291229", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_1716092689624562_6038257867077367159_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IYqml7xhp8IQ7kNvwG36y76&_nc_oc=AdrxD0iDcpbehi4_F-scml53LU0RsMKikZBKkdO3A7YTFrPx-4ga3Ro-9FxHIg3EbfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFY8C-d_IwKHYhjwIIhwfKYszJ0vzYxvKVFvKwzVpWOIw&oe=6A786CDE"}, {"file_name": "Screen6.png", "id": "1351435473722523", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_1351435477055856_8057843445529565454_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JFQFD6NWVkIQ7kNvwFZslE_&_nc_oc=AdoJMUvJAjV__-rOvrycsZLDY0Tyy6dWWsmI9W2CObaQrNEEWpku_wIpxZGl5let-Q8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFpXG0lI7a905VnL2TjNW10yaxZUiRHiC1ryIkeKGf4qg&oe=6A788B1B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Epic VR Drone Flight Through Fireworks", "keywords": ["fireworks", "drone", "festival", "vrtravelx", "night"], "long_description": "Experience fireworks from a breathtaking new perspective. A drone takes you on a spectacular VR journey straight through a real fireworks show above a beautiful lake. Rockets, sparkling trails, and brilliant explosions race past you while their vibrant colors reflect across the water below.\n\nBut the spectacle doesn't end there. At the very same time, a second major fireworks display launches from a nearby hillside behind the crowd. From the air, you can witness both performances together as they illuminate the night sky from different directions. The authentic atmosphere on the ground completes the experience with the excitement, cheers, and applause of the audience.\n\nEvery scene was captured during a real fireworks event using an aerial drone, creating an experience that goes far beyond a traditional fireworks video. Instead of simply watching, you become part of the flight and can freely look in every direction throughout the entire 360\u00b0 experience.\n\nEnjoy this unforgettable spectacle in virtual reality or explore the full 360\u00b0 scene on your smartphone, tablet, or computer. Wherever you look, another incredible view awaits, delivering one of the most immersive ways to experience the beauty, excitement, and scale of a real fireworks celebration.\n\nThis app includes streamed experiences and requires a stable internet connection. \nStreamed content is provided by the developer and may not be available indefinitely.\n\n", "short_description": "In spectacular fashion, a drone takes you in VR straight into a real fireworks show over a lake. Rockets, showers of sparks, and explosions race right past you and reflect across the dark water. But one fireworks show is not enough: at the same time, a second massive display lights up the hill and turns the sky from another direction into a sea of color. Far below, the crowd\u2019s awe, cheers, and applause complete this extraordinary 360\u00b0 experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrtravelx.net/home/Epic-VR-Drone-Flight-Through-Fireworks", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRTRavelX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.vrtravelx.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": nul